            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "Never mind the plumber, the hedgehog is coming to Steam!<br>THE GAME FEATURES CLASSIC GAMEPLAY, AND VR MODE AS WELL.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2>Ziggy the hedgehog is living an interesting life on a golf course, but various naughty creatures want to spoil all the fun. Help Ziggy to avoid the obstacles, retrieve all of his golf equipment, and safely roll a ball down a golf hole.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game</h2>Ziggy's Chase is a 3D platformer with colorful graphics and multitude of obstacles and enemies. You can run, jump and shoot, and also use some other kinds of transportation like boat or a seesaw. It has the visual vibe of some older console games, but with many new tweaks and perks.<br><br>THE GAME FEATURES CLASSIC GAMEPLAY, AND VR MODE AS WELL.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>enjoy rich cartoon graphics<br></li><li>fight or avoid odd creatures and machines that invaded your golf course<br></li><li>pick up goodies for foodies to achieve better score<br></li><li>use platforms, seesaws and boats to reach remote parts of the island<br></li><li>use hidden contraptions to open doors<br></li><li>groove to the original funky music<br></li><li>30 levels of pure fun</li></ul>",
